From fb6410963dfe636c3b24705f265c9cf14d2a941b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pieroviano <piero.viano@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 03:26:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Sweep: accessibility/system enums, designer interfaces,
 layout settings

Additive types, signatures/values from the net48 reference:

- Enums: AccessibleNavigation, AccessibleSelection, BootMode, PowerState,
  ScreenOrientation, SecurityIDType, StructFormat,
  Design.ToolStripItemDesignerAvailability.
- Interfaces: ICommandExecutor, IFileReaderService, IDataGridViewEditingCell,
  Design.IUIService, Design.IWindowsFormsEditorService,
  Design.IComponentEditorPageSite.
- LayoutSettings (abstract) + FlowLayoutSettings (FlowDirection/WrapContents/
  flow-break map), backed by the Layout.LayoutEngine.
- ImeModeConversion struct.
- ListBindingHelper: the existing internal helper is promoted to public (it
  already had the full GetList/GetListItemProperties/GetListItemType surface),
  which is what the reference exposes.

Net48 public types present 890->907 (missing 144->127). Full suite green at 2347
(+5 tests: enum values, interface definitions, FlowLayoutSettings behaviour,
ImeModeConversion defaults, ListBindingHelper public + list resolution).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
